oing </span><span begin="00:19.040" end="00:19.430">out </span><span begin="00:19.430" end="00:19.580">of </span><span begin="00:19.580" end="00:19.820">my </span><span begin="00:19.820" end="00:20.360">mind</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.540" end="00:29.210"><span begin="00:20.540" end="00:20.870">It </span><span begin="00:20.870" end="00:21.170">was </span><span begin="00:21.170" end="00:22.610">heaven </span><span begin="00:22.610" end="00:23.420">when </span><span begin="00:23.420" end="00:23.510">I </span><span begin="00:23.510" end="00:24.740">finally </span><span begin="00:24.740" end="00:25.880">figured </span><span begin="00:25.880" end="00:26.240">it </span><span begin="00:26.240" end="00:27.050">out </span><span begin="00:27.050" end="00:29.210">alone</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.040" end="00:33.980"><span begin="00:31.040" end="00:31.370">Didn't </span><span begin="00:31.370" end="00:31.760">get </span><span begin="00:31.760" end="00:31.970">it </span><span begin="00:31.970" end="00:32.210">the </span><span begin="00:32.210" end="00:32.870">first </span><span begin="00:32.870" end="00:33.980">time</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.780" end="00:39.200"><span begin="00:35.780" end="00:36.020">But </span><span begin="00:36.020" end="00:36.260">don't </span><span begin="00:36.260" end="00:36.710">think </span><span begin="00:36.710" end="00:36.950">I've </span><span begin="00:36.950" end="00:37.220">been </span><span begin="00:37.220" end="00:37.790">so </span><span begin="00:37.790" end="00:39.200">blind</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.970" end="00:43.160"><span begin="00:40.970" end="00:41.180">And </span><span begin="00:41.180" end="00:41.240">I </span><span begin="00:41.240" end="00:41.570">may </span><span begin="00:41.570" end="00:41.870">not </span><span begin="00:41.870" end="00:42.290">be </span><span begin="00:42.290" end="00:43.160">unstopped</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.160" end="00:46.280"><span begin="00:43.160" end="00:43.340">But </span><span begin="00:43.340" end="00:43.430">I </span><span begin="00:43.430" end="00:43.670">know </span><span begin="00:43.670" end="00:44.300">Dumb </span><span begin="00:44.300" end="00:44.900">plus </span><span begin="00:44.900" end="00:45.380">dumb </span><span begin="00:45.380" end="00:45.980">equals </span><span begin="00:45.980" end="00:46.280">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.280" end="00:51.110"><span begin="00:46.280" end="00:46.910">Dumb </span><span begin="00:46.910" end="00:47.150">plus </span><span begin="00:47.150" end="00:47.780">dumb </span><span begin="00:47.780" end="00:48.440">equals </span><span begin="00:48.440" end="00:51.110">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.110" end="00:55.160"><span begin="00:51.110" end="00:51.710">Dumb </span><span begin="00:51.710" end="00:52.340">plus </span><span begin="00:52.340" end="00:52.790">dumb </span><span begin="00:52.790" end="00:53.390">equals </span><span begin="00:53.390" end="00:55.160">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.190" end="00:59.960"><span begin="00:55.190" end="00:55.790">Even </span><span begin="00:55.790" end="00:56.420">had </span><span begin="00:56.420" end="00:56.630">the </span><span begin="00:56.630" end="00:57.110">nerves </span><span begin="00:57.110" end="00:57.230">to </span><span begin="00:57.230" end="00:57.650">flirt </span><span begin="00:57.650" end="00:57.950">with </span><span begin="00:57.950" end="00:58.340">her </span><span begin="00:58.340" end="00:58.490">in </span><span begin="00:58.490" end="00:58.910">front </span><span begin="00:58.910" end="00:59.180">of </span><span begin="00:59.180" end="00:59.450">my </span><span begin="00:59.450" end="00:59.960">face</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.990" end="01:02.090"><span begin="00:59.990" end="01:00.560">Here's </span><span begin="01:00.560" end="01:00.710">your </span><span begin="01:00.710" end="01:01.430">keys</span><span begin="01:01.430" e